  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-06-05T22:09:45.213Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It would be nice to have an option to define our own sensitivity threshold. As someone who DJs and dances in game, where playing music through Voicemeeter and as a mic source to the game, it is often found that sounds will cut out if it is too low. The default threshold in game is too high. Playing music through in world players is not always an option and this would be a good quality of life update for users. If Discord can have an option to define sensitivity, why can't we have it for VRChat?",
